            {
              "scan": "s115",
              "printed_page": "43",
              "text": "to generation does He endure and His Name endures, His throne is firmly founded and His realm and His faithfulness endure for ever. And His words are living and eternal, faithful and delightful always and in all eternity for our fathers and for us, for our children and our coming generations and all the generations of the seed of Israel Thy servants.",
